            "review_title": "Review at Sumibozu",
            "review_text": "Logica_2248\nAarhus, Denmark33 contributions\n1\nIncredible Japanese food in Hanoi\nOct 2018 • Couples\nOn a whim after a quick google-search, we went to have dinner at Sumibozu. We LOVED it! They were very busy, but managed to seat us in front of the grill. The menu is entirely Japanese, but they took us through it and we ordered a bit of everything. \nThe food was excellent and came rapidly in succession. \nVery sweet lady in front and nice servers. We regretted that we didn't have time to return. Hopefully another time!\nRead more\nWritten January 16, 2019",
